{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_18670","headline":"韦使君黄溪祈雨见召从行至祠下口号 · 柳宗元","name":"韦使君黄溪祈雨见召从行至祠下口号","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"骄阳愆岁事，良牧念菑畲。\n列骑低残月，鸣笳度碧虚。\n稍穷樵客路，遥驻野人居。\n谷口寒流净，丛祠古木疎。\n焚香秋雾湿，奠玉晓光初。\n肸蠁巫言报，精诚礼物余。\n惠风仍偃草，灵雨会随车。\n俟罪非真吏，翻惭奉简书。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"柳宗元","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_18670.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_18670","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}